     2607   define variable loc-name as character  VIEW-AS fill-in size 20 by 1 fgcolor RED_COLOR no-undo.
     2608   define variable loc-code as character  VIEW-AS fill-in size 20 by 1 fgcolor RED_COLOR no-undo.
