     3362            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
     3363            ) = 0
     3364   then do:
