     3381   ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-cur-add DO:
     3382   define variable vss-include-info52 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     3383   if lookup(b-add :type in frame d-pr-alt
     3384            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
     3385            ) = 0
     3386   then do:
