     3403   ON CHOOSE OF b-del in frame d-pr-alt DO:
     3404   define variable vss-include-info53 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     3405   if lookup(self :type
     3406            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
     3407            ) = 0
     3408   then do:
     3409     message
     3410       "$Workfile$"
